{"id":"u-ac84e8f3-eaaa-467f-baeb-5d2bb38a129d","src":"community","title":"5 Day Full Body Routine","author":"Giovanni .","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/0EzPEE-5-day-full-body-routine","desc":"A 5-day full-body program built for high-frequency hypertrophy training toward a V-taper physique. Every session trains all major movement patterns — squat/hinge, pull, push, delts, arms, and core — with the specific exercise and emphasis rotating daily to prevent repetitive joint stress and manage fatigue. \n\nDirect shoulder width work (lateral raises, rear delt work) appears in every session for maximum frequency on the primary aesthetic target, while squat and hinge patterns rotate to avoid consecutive-day overload on the same joints. 6 exercises/day, 3 sets, 8-12 reps (12-15 for delts/calves/core), under 45 minutes.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":40,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-09-28T04:57:59.423Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3","Day 4","Day 5"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Assisted)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Overhead Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hanging Leg Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":6,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":6,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Calf Raise","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":